// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`US-DELTA-003 — delta CLI parser and help > roll delta help is localized to zh when ROLL_LANG=zh 1`] = `
"用法：roll delta <prepare|validate|conclude|status|help>

  Delta Team（host-guided）= 当前宿主主会话（隐式 Supervisor）加上由宿主 native
  能力创建的 Designer/Builder/Evaluator 子会话，通过 roll delta 驱动。Roll 从不
  spawn、resume 或配置任何会话（包括你自己的）。

  受管运行时边界：
    - solo 或 delta-team 的 prepare 会原子持有 Story 交付预留，在
      .roll/loop/worktrees 下创建一个受管 WorkspaceSet，并返回 detached checkout
      和 publish-ref 身份。Builder 只能在该工作区开始。
    - host-guided full-delta-team 会在副作用前被拒绝；Full Delta 只附着到既有 Cycle
      WorkspaceSet，绝不创建嵌套 Delta 工作区。
    - handoff_ready 会保留预留和工作区；它不是 Done、merge、attest 裁定或
      DeliveryRecord。清理必须有已确认合并、已接受 attest 和新鲜的全成员检查。
    - 旧路径/外部路径只会作为 unknown 或 unmanaged 可见；Roll 从不自动认领或删除。

  如实的协议边界：
    - 宿主 attestation 仅结构校验（token 非空/唯一且在 resolution/事件/manifest 间
      对应）；绝不证明会话新起或模型执行过。
    - preset 放在 ~/.roll/delta-team/presets.yaml（仅宿主本地配置）。
    - host-guided 成本渲染 ? (host_unobservable)——绝不估算或写零。

  宿主导引的委派生命周期命令（仅协议层；不启任何 agent）。

  roll delta prepare <story-id> --trigger host-guided --topology solo|delta-team|full-delta-team --profile standard|verified|designed --preset <id> --resolution <path> [--json]
    原子预留交付、分配受管工作区，并创建不可变帧。

  roll delta validate --delegation <id> --stage designer|builder|evaluator|peer [--json]
    经过协议校验边界验证角色阶段提交。

  roll delta conclude --delegation <id> --delivery-disposition owner_continue|owner_hold|owner_redelegate [--json]
    记录 owner 批准的终止绑定（Option C：handoff_ready/handoff_only）。

  roll delta status [--story <id>|--delegation <id>] [--json]
    从事件真相只读投影委派状态。

  roll delta help
    打印此帮助。
"
`;

exports[`US-DELTA-003 — delta CLI parser and help > roll delta help prints EN usage with all subcommands and exits 0 1`] = `
"Usage: roll delta <prepare|validate|conclude|status|help>

  Delta Team (host-guided) = the current host main session (implicit Supervisor)
  plus host-native Designer/Builder/Evaluator sub-agent sessions, driven through
  roll delta. Roll never spawns, resumes, or configures any session, including
  yours.

  Managed-runtime boundary:
    - prepare for solo or delta-team atomically holds the Story delivery reservation,
      creates one managed WorkspaceSet beneath .roll/loop/worktrees, and returns its
      detached checkout and publish-ref identity. Start the Builder only there.
    - host-guided full-delta-team is refused before side effects; Full Delta attaches
      to an existing Cycle WorkspaceSet and never creates a nested Delta workspace.
    - handoff_ready preserves the reservation and workspace. It is NOT Done, a merge,
      an attest verdict, or a DeliveryRecord. Cleanup needs confirmed merge plus
      accepted attest and a fresh all-member inspection.
    - Legacy/external paths remain visible as unknown or unmanaged; Roll never adopts
      or deletes them automatically.

  Honest protocol boundary:
    - Host attestation is structural validation only (non-empty/unique tokens that
      correspond across resolution/event/manifest); never proof of a fresh session
      or that a model executed.
    - Presets live in ~/.roll/delta-team/presets.yaml (host-local config only).
    - Host-guided cost renders ? (host_unobservable) — never estimated or zeroed.

  Host-guided delegation lifecycle commands (protocol-only; no agent spawning).

  roll delta prepare <story-id> --trigger host-guided --topology solo|delta-team|full-delta-team --profile standard|verified|designed --preset <id> --resolution <path> [--json]
    Atomically reserve delivery, allocate the managed workspace, and create the immutable frame.

  roll delta validate --delegation <id> --stage designer|builder|evaluator|peer [--json]
    Validate a role-stage submission through the protocol-validator boundary.

  roll delta conclude --delegation <id> --delivery-disposition owner_continue|owner_hold|owner_redelegate [--json]
    Record owner-approved terminal binding (Option C: handoff_ready/handoff_only).

  roll delta status [--story <id>|--delegation <id>] [--json]
    Read-only delegation status projection from event truth.

  roll delta help
    Print this help.
"
`;
